l,"idx":null,"text":"期末考快到了，作業和考試(　)，大家都很忙碌。","n":23,"ssz":".........1............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老師講的那句話看似輕鬆，其實(　)，讓我想了很久。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每到冬天，候鳥會隨著氣候變化進行(　)，飛往較溫暖的地區。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這部電影的劇情和上一部(　)，觀眾一開始就猜到結局。","n":26,"ssz":".......1.........2........"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這家店總是大排長龍，對附近的居民來說早已(　)。","n":24,"ssz":".......1................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請問下列語詞，何者使用錯誤？","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這條馬路又直又長，一直通向遠方，看起來「如出一轍」","n":25,"ssz":".........2............1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這本書用故事開場的方式講解歷史，內容「引人入勝」","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他長年救災，面對災難事件早已「司空見慣」，仍能冷靜處理","n":27,"ssz":".........1................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這位設計師的想法「天馬行空」，創意常讓人眼睛為之一亮","n":26,"ssz":"........................1."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"作者說語言「即使過了數百年歲月的淘洗，發音已經略有改變，仍可溯源」，最接近的意思是什麼？","n":44,"ssz":".......................................2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語言一旦發音改變，就很難再追查到更早的來源","n":21,"ssz":"..1.................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語言隨著時間推移會逐漸消失，因此不具研究價值","n":22,"ssz":"................1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語言即使發音改變，仍可能追查到更早的來源與根源","n":23,"ssz":"